#: ../../tools/simbad_tools.rst:32 be607ae8964f4264ad84db8247616ae8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Execute advanced ADQL (Astronomical Data Query Language)"
" queries on SIMBAD using TAP (Table Access Protocol). Allows complex "
"database queries with SQL-like syntax for sophisticated astronomical data"
" searches. Use this for queries that require joins, filtering, or complex"
" conditions."
msgstr ""

